msgid "`Configure cgroup driver used by kubelet on Master Node <https://kubernetes.io/docs/setup/independent/install-kubeadm/#configure-cgroup-driver-used-by-kubelet-on-master-node>`_"
msgstr "`Configure cgroup driver used by kubelet on Master Node <https://kubernetes.io/docs/setup/independent/install-kubeadm/#configure-cgroup-driver-used-by-kubelet-on-master-node>`_"

